# deploy/hiclaw/Dockerfile.manager
# HiClaw Manager container — applies to HiClaw v1.0.6
#
# UPGRADE CHECKLIST (see docs/patches/hiclaw-interface-contract-v1.md):
#   1. Verify x-honeybadge field passthrough (Manager must not strip x-honeybadge)
#   2. Verify Worker SKILL.md syntax is compatible with new version
#   3. Verify mcporter MCP call conventions unchanged
#   4. Verify Matrix DM room auto-accept behavior unchanged
